+Parsing, the `.info` file, FCIDUMP, XACC, and `--mp2` all work with just
+NumPy. Missing an optional dependency never crashes an unrelated part of a
+run: `--format all` silently skips `pyscf` if PySCF isn't installed (with a
+one-line notice), and a solver flag that needs a missing package reports a
+clear error naming that flag alone.
