+## Layout
+
+```
+hamiltonian_extractor/
+├── extract_hamiltonian.py   # CLI entry point
+├── parsing.py                # output_file + .ducc.results.txt -> HamiltonianData
+├── hamiltonian_data.py        # HamiltonianData: raw integrals + derived quantities
+├── format_writer.py           # FormatWriter base class; .info writer
+├── fcidump_writer.py          # this project's own FCIDUMP convention
+├── xacc_writer.py             # XACC format
+├── pyscf_backend.py           # mock PySCF mean-field + standard FCIDUMP writer
+├── fci_solver.py               # FCI via PySCF          (optional: pyscf)
+├── ccsd_solver.py              # CCSD via PySCF          (optional: pyscf)
+├── miniccpy_solver.py          # correlated methods via miniccpy (optional: miniccpy)
+├── mp2_solver.py                # built-in MP2 (no extra dependency)
+└── Test/                        # H2O example + regression tests
+```
+
+## Adding a new output format
+
+Subclass `FormatWriter` (`write(data)`, `get_file_extension()`,
+`get_description()`) and add it to `get_format_writers()` in
+`extract_hamiltonian.py`. See `xacc_writer.py` for a minimal example.
